					"content": "呼呼——呼呼——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭非拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220502,
					"content": "蘭非拉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220503,
					"content": "嗯？原來是派蒙啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭非拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220504,
					"content": "#對啊，我們是來告訴你，外面的「大怪物」，{NICKNAME}已經處理掉啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220505,
					"content": "#喔喔。沒想到，看起來沒有大怪物大的那菈{NICKNAME}，居然有這樣的力量。好強。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220506,
						730220507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭非拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220506,
					"content": "還好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730220508,
					"content": "嗯。那我們出發吧。好那菈，我們一起吃果實。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭非拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730220507,
					"content": "挺棘手的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730220508
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302206,
